# FFGen - Focused Feedback Generation

A complete ML pipeline for generating focused feedback on code using Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) and fine-tuned embedding models.

## Overview

FFGen implements a comprehensive ML pipeline with hard negative mining for superior embedding model training:

1. **Data Mining & Acquisition**: Extract and parse source code files
2. **Data Processing & Preprocessing**: Generate synthetic feedback using multi-agent LLM system
3. **Hard Negative Mining** : Mine challenging negatives using cosine similarity (crucial for triplet loss)
4. **Model Training & Finetuning**: Train embedding models for code-feedback matching

